      "text": "Releasing payment (approve, override)\nabove the analyst limit, or with an\nunreadable total, is the AP Manager's.\nRejecting and requesting a credit note\nare open to analysts at any amount.\n\nEvery decision and correction needs\na comment and is kept in the history.",
